{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A confirmed merge can be reported as needing review or landing when the saved PR snapshot is missing or stale."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"A digest generated while requested changes are being applied incorrectly lists the PR as awaiting review."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An external push after an acknowledged approval can invalidate the approval without causing the digest to list the PR for review."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A blocked landing remains in the digest after the PR is confirmed merged if the saved snapshot does not reflect the merge."},{"id":"C5","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A large unread candidate backlog causes serial per-run requests on every session start, delaying the digest."},{"id":"C8","consequence":"outage","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A sufficiently long persisted question can flood or exceed an agent session's context when the digest is inserted."},{"id":"C9","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An incomplete PR observation can cause status to report an older failed review round despite a later approval."},{"id":"C11","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"MCP review approvals are persisted and reported as made by a human, giving incorrect audit provenance."},{"id":"C12","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Following the Codex skill's shared consumer instruction can hide activity already acknowledged under Claude's cursor."}]}